1
00:00:00,185 --> 00:00:01,298
Tezkor savol!

2
00:00:01,298 --> 00:00:05,301
Qaysi biri rezavor meva: banan yoki qulupnay?

3
00:00:05,301 --> 00:00:06,445
Kutilmagan burilish!

4
00:00:06,445 --> 00:00:09,341
Banan rezavor meva hisoblanadi, qulupnay esa yo‘q!

5
00:00:09,341 --> 00:00:11,186
Botanikada haqiqiy rezavor meva

6
00:00:11,216 --> 00:00:13,857
bitta gulning yagona tugunchasidan rivojlanadi.

7
00:00:13,857 --> 00:00:15,867
Qulupnay esa boshqacha rivojlanadi.

8
00:00:15,867 --> 00:00:17,853
Uning tashqi yuzasidagi mayda nuqtalar-chi?

9
00:00:17,853 --> 00:00:19,933
Aslida ular mitti mevachalar!

10
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:23,289
“Plot twist” degani kutilmagan burilish.

11
00:00:23,289 --> 00:00:25,979
Tasavvur qiling: qulupnayga u rezavor emasligini aytdingiz.

12
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:27,109
Uning javobi-chi?

13
00:00:27,109 --> 00:00:29,364
Axir nomimda “BERRY” so‘zi turibdi-ku!
